{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "99f9f14fea4596fe9a5c6fed230181db527dc4daef55571a69fd55f337de3b01", "ja": "仲間で、ライバル", "zh": "是伙伴，也是竞争对手", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b3313d5519078ab3a71f956994ba3f511722665fe2d915a3b4a0e48949460a00", "ja": "自分なりに頑張る理由を見つけた未来はレッ\nスンも好調。一方静香は焦り気味。ふたりに\n追いつくため個人練習する静香に、プロデュ\nーサーは、無理をするのではなく、頑張るべ\nき事を考えて欲しいとアドバイスする。", "zh": "找到属于自己的努力理由后，未来的练习也很顺利。另一方面，静香却有些焦急。为了追上两人而进行个人练习的静香，得到了制作人的建议：不要勉强自己，而是想想自己真正应该努力的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "03591901d98b7599499006bf3a8632a72b68555022d457625e22297db28cb0b0", "ja": "（今日は、どうしても外せない打ち合わせがあって\n様子を見に行けないけど……未来と静香、大丈夫かな）", "zh": "（今天有个无论如何都不能缺席的会议，没法去看看情况……未来和静香，没问题吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ee1d25ba0c994d3d46c49e71998ee69fd991594d4b2532cb86db3a8e4e59b835", "ja": "（未来達の次のレッスンは……春香と美希だな。\n少し様子を見てもらうよう、頼んでみるか）", "zh": "（未来她们下一节课是和春香、美希一起吧。要不要拜托她们帮忙稍微照看一下呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "326b5061e8f98615cdf4c14246648cd00a4036cb7166584b176d66c9feafd796", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー！\n……どう？　翼！　今の、キマってたよね！？", "zh": "一、二、三、四！\n……怎么样？翼！刚才那下，很帅吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "50e09c5fca789c05213394e0e54182f71a8f3e901b0acf7fe4a3525516827079", "ja": "うんうん、よくできました♪　わたしは知ってたよ、\n未来はちゃんと練習すればできるようになるって。", "zh": "嗯嗯，做得很棒哦♪我就知道，\n未来只要好好练习就一定能做到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "f98ba796ca694ee9741a5cea43621b0b63e71590a41496fb9f26f450ddecc3bf", "ja": "でへへ～♪\nそれほどでもないって～。", "zh": "嘿嘿～♪\n也没那么厉害啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "de3ae20585647f94c43861dfc3bede93f2e4b218f4d6ed23746dc24278bf1d45", "ja": "翼も、だいぶ調子がいいみたいね。\n難しいステップも一発で決めてたし。", "zh": "翼的状态似乎也相当不错。连高难度的舞步都一次就完成了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c0432e659f1eeb470b1cc13941730153a0661e39fa7a9d636ecc88c42ea289fe", "ja": "{$P$}さんにほめられたからかな？\nこの調子だと、わたしがセンターとっちゃうかも～。", "zh": "可能是因为被{$P$}先生夸奖了吧？\n照这个势头，说不定C位会被我拿走哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "8769b314827188cbb4305b4b8aca28ec8d3ce5f53849888bd212c322de452010", "ja": "わ、私だって、翼には負けないわよ！", "zh": "我、我也不会输给翼的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "e2e214ba102d5d7c2cc223360c03695c1872e1526f8b622d0a537bd4c83d5552", "ja": "静香ちゃん、私はどうだった！？　私、静香ちゃんに\n置いていかれないようにって、がんばったんだけど！", "zh": "静香，我表现得怎么样！？我为了不被你甩在后面，可是很努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "1cfd5dad4cb6b19d51dfd2ca895f48e6ea214d78de3b39632146ccbe77f67344", "ja": "えっ……あ、ええと、未来は……。", "zh": "诶……啊，那个，未来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1010_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "556eb8483e99e9c43ccdf4f0443626924c973f5d8c98be48f003b318fa5c0b50", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！", "zh": "大家辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a7a021f2a946e66bea897b24a1e7fb113be2a6b0480175fe73934216c4f9efff", "ja": "あっ、春香さん、美希ちゃ……美希先輩！\nどうしたんですか？", "zh": "啊，春香前辈，美希……美希前辈！\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "56300361ac17cd2b3ac83366e4d89488fa033188f3060ad200cd819501d2cc11", "ja": "翼達の次は、ミキ達の練習の時間だよ。\nでも、今日は春香とふたりだけなんだけどね。", "zh": "翼她们之后，就轮到我们练习了哦。不过，今天只有我和春香两个人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "49f009061a5409e3096a2f611d7a44ed75b6ada6ede9d1808058a9aa5399443b", "ja": "えっ……いけない、もうこんな時間！？\nすみません、すぐに片付けますね。", "zh": "诶……糟了，已经这么晚了！？  \n对不起，我马上收拾好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "973c046116e7ad7be3289afaf792cb41fb2fd6a3d554cfb7ac05bd6aff58a459", "ja": "急がなくても大丈夫だよ。\n私たちが、すこし早めに来ただけだから。", "zh": "不用着急也没关系的。\n只是我们稍微来早了一点而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "3ce95a56fe7e4df7faf2e2334dadda1d40c70d9acdad7a86bf460e1d4b653e62", "ja": "それより、レッスン見せてもらってたんだけど……\n未来ちゃん、すごく良くなったね！　ね、美希♪", "zh": "比起这个，我刚才在看你的练习……未来，你进步得真大呀！对吧，美希♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "8b9e1a54062da8788bc864e3aa2915a4584e8a7e6b6ff8e6988ae9c9bc4accad", "ja": "うん。未来のダンス、前より上手になったかも？", "zh": "嗯。未来的舞蹈，可能比以前跳得更好了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "413932e04acfbb76a202d9fede2d2d82c114764abb7e8397c0e24934669db431", "ja": "え～っ、本当ですか！？　やったやった～、\n春香さんと美希ちゃんにほめられた～！", "zh": "诶～，真的吗！？太好了太好了～，\n春香和美希夸我了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "027ba6a3bd39f4e0268511f49103efb02627e75d0cb2d5a3ee8a295574a475aa", "ja": "静香？　なんか今日、おとなしいね。", "zh": "静香？总觉得你今天挺安静的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "848555aa3c5ffa726a68e6a6477102d1de10dde7f64f7771174d3070876049bc", "ja": "えっ！？\nそんなことない……と、思いますけど……。", "zh": "诶！？\n没、没有那回事……我想……应该是吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bd2b5c1d451b9cc8da45b4709a395687773c2a835fccc2bb425120797a4b7c0c", "ja": "美希先輩、言ってやってください。静香ちゃん、\nずっとヘンなんですよ～。未来もだけど！", "zh": "美希前辈，你快说说她。静香一直都很奇怪呢～未来也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "189b5f58855010633945775bc103339a20b463c8c407d30d1316e7d0150e3c4b", "ja": "えっ。わ、私？", "zh": "咦？我、我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "db37d1f58121a4a80442e9988a5feb45d7edcfff94d30626d7d266c61ea4e1c6", "ja": "ちょっと、翼！　そんな、別に私、\nヘンなんかじゃ……。", "zh": "等等，翼！哪有，我又没什么奇怪的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b8adf13f616d821015014bed2c810b7320abb5b1296bc91e10d2dadbcbc72ff7", "ja": "そんなことあるってば！　最近ふたりしてずっと\nヘンな感じで、練習しててもつまんないんだから。", "zh": "当然有这种事啊！最近你们俩一直都怪怪的，连练习都变得无聊了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1026_001har", "source_sha256": "5a80a5212c0343df1ffb3590fae321fbe16a1fca4b2d2742d802579da7b0ff0b", "ja": "そうなんだ……ふたりとも、ケンカでもしたの？", "zh": "这样啊……你们两个，是不是吵架了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "ff70405c670a2d35032a1aff94b18bed1788f3271400e02813e1544bcea902b7", "ja": "ケンカなんて、してません。\nね、未来！", "zh": "才没有吵架。\n对吧，未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "9811d46d09c8e2a306625c4c2269e6906d554e945328984b65bc54d18fa7de43", "ja": "う、うん……。", "zh": "呃、嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1029_003mik", "source_sha256": "b7b3159c49588b8085e8e66bc0bc7ca00efaa4ae45b15852d2e2f6818cd216b0", "ja": "えー。ふたりとも、なんだか怪しいの……。", "zh": "诶——你们两个，总觉得有点可疑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "b8a8c29e3b6ba5fd72abf61c7ddd3f40a6c6cb618b9e4cc5276c58ab115ceafc", "ja": "そっか。……でも劇場でアイドルをしている限り、\nどんなにケンカをしても、仲間とは離れられないよね。", "zh": "这样啊。……不过，只要还在剧场当偶像，不管吵得多凶，也没办法和伙伴分开吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1031_001har", "source_sha256": "09ea2a8f047bd0f3d9ce35c91f02e7b77366a0ea584bf19dd50da4325c7c661d", "ja": "すれ違っても、それこそ大ゲンカしても。\nいっしょに練習して、仕事もしなくちゃならないから。", "zh": "就算产生分歧，甚至大吵一架。因为还得一起练习，也必须一起工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1783f653e5c7183a0b3164ccbf2d68572f786b8f2bedcddaed49b89488a7ff34", "ja": "そうですよね～。公演の前とか、家族より\n劇場のみんなとのほうが、いっしょにいる時間長いし！", "zh": "就是啊～比如演出前，和剧场大家待在一起的时间，比和家人还长呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1033_001har", "source_sha256": "a828fd02e1bc524a1d7a381154e982b7ab99154923c59edad2208a9a39f2ea7c", "ja": "うん。劇場って、大家族みたいなものなのかも？\n運命共同体、っていうのかな。", "zh": "嗯。剧场说不定就像个大家族一样呢？\n或者该说是命运共同体吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1034_014mir", "source_sha256": "7be812e38c433dec442e8426b1b196153f52eec166170c0e03810cd30fbb45f3", "ja": "運命共同体……？", "zh": "命运共同体……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1035_003mik", "source_sha256": "286e463d9446e5b2d32e8747ed4b65d796b400a5bfa958289896dea2fcca17c0", "ja": "でも、いっしょにできないコトもあるけどね。\nネクスト・アイドル・ウェーブに出るのはミキ達なの！", "zh": "不过，也有些事情没办法一起做嘛。\n参加“下一代偶像浪潮”的可是美希她们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1036_001har", "source_sha256": "274bb97fca9029bd2d41935e19dab54bb14b7e8104db9f7cc093d6dd0d7005cd", "ja": "うん……そうだね。私だって、美希には負けないよ！\nもちろん、未来ちゃんたちにもね！", "zh": "嗯……没错。就算是我，也不会输给美希！\n当然，也不会输给未来她们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "eb7fc3e9e202603ff46a650829ff6ae2c6234ec88aa6827b083cec17a026461c", "ja": "（今日の打ち合わせは長引いたな。……ん？\nレッスンルームにまだ人がいるな。あれは……）", "zh": "（今天的会议拖得真久啊。……嗯？练习室里还有人啊。那是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1039_015siz", "source_sha256": "0e1bf20d75de9e503b1e1c2f1fb0b80a9f91c027c4609a96c6276f5f9c69acbb", "ja": "私は、いつもどおり。自分のことに集中しなきゃ……。", "zh": "我还是和往常一样。得专心做好自己的事才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1040_p", "source_sha256": "578fc104958c8f0a59e4df78db144610ecc14c60e005b8dba1c8a71425cd680c", "ja": "お疲れさま、静香。こんな時間まで自主練か？\n根を詰めるのもいいけど、ほどほどにしないとな。", "zh": "辛苦了，静香。练习到这么晚吗？\n努力过头也不好，还是要适可而止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1041_015siz", "source_sha256": "0db02df0bc5819e4d523f48642e84154a1ac140281742adddc9f2582dbfc8f67", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\nええ、わかってます。けど……。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n嗯，我知道。可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1042_015siz", "source_sha256": "381f98f1df0962b1f90a75c456a68137a6890bc0f98d678469433d9a72ff763e", "ja": "未来も翼も、どんどん先へ進んでいるんです。\n私だけ、こんなふうに調子を崩したままじゃ……。", "zh": "未来和翼都在不断向前。  \n只有我还一直这样状态不佳的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1043_p", "source_sha256": "56d5aa3007417dc28fa4199b87f08a73418fce084e66c53f264a1e22b2d5e6cc", "ja": "だからって無理をしても、いい結果が出るとは\n限らないだろ？　今日はしっかり体を休めた方が……。", "zh": "话虽如此，就算勉强自己，也不一定能有好结果吧？今天还是好好休息一下身体比较……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1044_015siz", "source_sha256": "4c0bffc6b44fa838333c57c2587e32670a0276bef207d7764792141c751c6402", "ja": "それくらい、わかってますっ！　……あっ。\nす、すみません。私……。", "zh": "这点我还是知道的！……啊。\n对、对不起。我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1045_p", "source_sha256": "612e00336455e2ebcfcd01ed632070d48c84c4c56850e4dbf7f9d4f984681a88", "ja": "……静香。今度のオーディションは、ネクスト・\nアイドル・ウェーブの出場者を決めるためのものだ。", "zh": "……静香。这次试镜，是为了决定Next Idol Wave的参赛偶像而举行的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1046_p", "source_sha256": "767f9addb14d2ed0c7f8d374298dc33ca63d71a91acde7d11c7ee02ffd669fbb", "ja": "ネクスト・アイドル・ウェーブの出場はユニット単位\nだけど、審査は個人も対象。それも話したよな？", "zh": "参加“Next·偶像·Wave”是以组合为单位，不过审查对象也包括个人。这些我也跟你说过了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1047_p", "source_sha256": "212706f7b7ca67276ecb6e88aa6e196f19d1dfbe3b16b3bf2fa4b9607c35292d", "ja": "未来や翼とセンターを争う事だけじゃない。\n今は、劇場の仲間全員が、ライバルも同然なんだ。", "zh": "不只是要和未来、翼争夺中心位。\n现在，剧场里的所有伙伴都称得上是对手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1049_p", "source_sha256": "4685701025b4f38d6491978c36ee4e49a9de8b058f2f3cee8ed04f468e59f46a", "ja": "全員がそれぞれの思いでもって、『勝ち』にくる。\n今、静香達が挑んでいるのは、そういう勝負だ。", "zh": "每个人都怀抱着各自的想法，为了“胜利”而来。\n现在，静香她们正在挑战的，就是这样的较量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1050_p", "source_sha256": "e7955c29657cdefa05abf77635efdcd7981b2d5c290c260dbb3c752e342a711f", "ja": "このオーディションを突破するために、何が必要か。\n静香自身、よく考えてみてほしい。", "zh": "为了通过这场试镜，需要些什么。\n静香，你自己也好好想一想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1051_015siz", "source_sha256": "b1d602c446227742d609109e7b612d5e4ccb5e56263279f7e940e6215f16fc52", "ja": "わかりました……。", "zh": "我明白了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0181_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_04_1052_p", "source_sha256": "8d5e3da16ba09f94ef81def9bc17265aeabb8159ca384f1f29ec6ad5cb606a1a", "ja": "（静香は、焦っている。けど、必ずわかるはずだ……\nこのユニットが勝つために、何が必要かを……）", "zh": "（静香很焦急。不过，她一定能明白的……明白这个组合想要获胜，究竟需要什么……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
